OL,3,AWant your job application to stand out?
OL,4,AEmployers say they look for these six
OL,5,Askills
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe ability to communicate, collaborate
OL,8,Fand solve problems are among skills
OL,9,Fthat employers say they are looking for
OL,10,Fin potential job hires.
OL,12,FIn a major five-year study, the
OL,13,FNational Foundation for Educational
OL,14,FResearch (NFER) identified six key
OL,15,Ftransferable skills that will count as
OL,16,Fmuch as qualifications in getting and
OL,17,Fkeeping a job in the coming decade.
