OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWant your job application to stand out?
OL,4,AEmployers say they look for these six
OL,5,Askills
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes as NFER research, published
OL,8,Flast year, suggests it may become even
OL,9,Fharder to find a job as AI and
OL,10,Fautomation could see up to three
OL,11,Fmillion low- to mid-level jobs
OL,12,Fdisappearing by 2035.
OL,14,FWith just under one million young
OL,15,Fpeople not in education, employment or
OL,16,Ftraining, we have been speaking to
OL,17,Fbusinesses about how people can
OL,18,Fdemonstrate the key skills employers
OL,19,Fare looking for.
